msgid ""
"AURA Group - 2025-yil 1-iyulda tashkil etilgan, bizneslar uchun ishonchli va"
" natijador IT hamkor."
msgstr ""
"AURA Group is a reliable and results-driven IT partner, founded on July 1, "
"2025."

#: .\templates\about.html:22
msgid "Bizning hikoyamiz"
msgstr "Our Story"

#: .\templates\about.html:23
msgid "Texnologiya va innovatsiya bilan kelajakni bunyod etamiz"
msgstr "Building the future with technology and innovation"

#: .\templates\about.html:25
msgid ""
"AURA Group 2025-yil 1-iyulda Boborahim Rustamqulov rahbarligida tashkil "
"etilgan. Kompaniya qisqa muddat ichida bizneslar uchun zamonaviy IT "
"xizmatlarni taqdim etuvchi ishonchli jamoaga aylandi."
msgstr ""
"AURA Group was founded on July 1, 2025 under the leadership of Boborahim "
"Rustamqulov. In a short period, the company became a trusted team delivering"
" modern IT services for businesses."

